  Description: "COMPANION / UNCOMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nPush ordinary enemies within
    the push cap. Basic damage is reduced by 70%.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTier
    1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE
    IN THE WAITING REALM\nA traveller whose buoyant body kept them working above
    flooded streets. A foreman charged rent for their air. They joined a rescue crew
    and carry a valve only they may open.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo additional periodic
    personal passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their
    stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated.
    Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nSource: gift / nursery
    / special reward; not ordinary shop stock.\r\nBonds: tidal, mask. Immortal. Weapon
    rolls on recruitment; three equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the
    talent forbids it."
